{"question_id": "2a1811e2", "hypothesis": "## Step-by-Step Answer\n\n**Step 1: Extract relevant dates from the memories.**\n\n- **Holi celebration date**: The user stated in the conversation on 2023/03/26: \"I just attended the Holi celebration at my local temple on **February 26th**.\"\n- **Sunday mass at St. Mary's Church date**: The user stated in the conversation on 2023/03/26: \"I just got back from Sunday mass at St. Mary's Church on **March 19th**.\"\n\n**Step 2: Calculate the number of days between the two dates.**\n\n- From February 26 to the end of February: 2 days (February 27 and February 28; note that 2023 is not a leap year, so February has 28 days)\n- From March 1 to March 19: 19 days\n- **Total: 2 + 19 = 21 days**\n\n**Answer: 21 days had passed between the Hindu festival of Holi (February 26, 2023) and the Sunday mass at St. Mary's Church (March 19, 2023).**", "verdict": "yes", "question_type": "temporal-reasoning"}
